# 全仓库统一 LF 行尾：让工作区文件与索引记录保持一致，避免 core.autocrlf=true
# 承诺的 CRLF 检出与 .editorconfig / Prettier 的 LF 写入互相拉扯，
# 产生「内容完全相同却一直显示已修改」的假改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理由 cmd.exe 执行，保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 原生资源与归档文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
